{
  "slug": "clickhouse",
  "name": "Clickhouse",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Connect Claude to your ClickHouse Cloud databases. Browse organizations, services, databases, and table schemas. Run read-only SQL queries against your data and get instant analytical answers. Monitor service backups, review billing costs, and inspect ClickPipe configurations - all through natural conversation.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `clickhouse-best-practices` (MUST USE when reviewing ClickHouse schemas, queries, or configurations), `setup` (Guides users through setting up the ClickHouse MCP server connection bundled with this plugin)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `clickhouse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install clickhouse@claude-plugins-official` from `ClickHouse/clickhouse-claude-code-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
